-- ============================================================

-- first_name | salary
-- -----------|--------
-- Sarrah     | 200000
-- Suzan      | 130000
-- Mandy      | 130000


-- ============================================================
-- Explanation
-- ============================================================

-- This is a SELF JOIN because the employees table is joined
-- with itself.
--
-- e1 represents the employee.
-- e2 represents the employee's manager.
--
-- e1.manager_id = e2.id
-- connects each employee with their manager.
--
-- e1.salary > e2.salary
-- filters the result to employees whose salary is greater
-- than their manager's salary.
